# Frontline — example environment variables (PLACEHOLDERS ONLY).
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values there. NEVER put real
# secrets in this file or commit them. Real `.env*` files are git-ignored;
# `.env.example` is committed and must contain placeholders only.
#
# These two Supabase values are REQUIRED — the app reads live resources from
# Supabase and runs AI through the `ai` edge function. There is no mock/offline
# or templated-AI fallback: without these set, resource and AI calls surface the
# error/retry state.
# NOTE: Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* at bundle time — restart the dev server
# after editing, and set these in EAS env for cloud builds.

# --- Supabase (Phase 10 backend) ---
# Project URL: Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL= 
# anon/publishable key — safe to ship in the client: RLS makes it strictly
# read-only. Newer projects issue `sb_publishable_...` keys, older ones a JWT
# anon key; either goes here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Server-side only (NOT read by the app) ----------------------------------
# scripts/seed.ts reads these from the shell or a git-ignored `.env.seed`:
#   SUPABASE_URL=                 (same project URL)
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=    (secret key — never EXPO_PUBLIC_*, never committed)
# The Claude key lives ONLY in Supabase Edge Function secrets:
#   supabase secrets set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#   supabase secrets set ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8   (optional override)
# For local `supabase functions serve`, put those two in supabase/functions/.env
# (git-ignored).

# --- Resource ingestion (WS-7, server-side only — NOT read by the app) --------
# ingestion/run.ts pulls real resources from provider APIs. It reads these from
# the shell or the same git-ignored `.env.seed` (it also needs SUPABASE_URL +
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY above for the live write):
#   VA_API_KEY=                   (free key from developer.va.gov — VA Facilities API)
#   VA_FACILITIES_BASE_URL=       (optional; defaults to the VA SANDBOX base.
#                                  Production: https://api.va.gov/services/va_facilities/v1)
#   USAJOBS_API_KEY=              (free key from developer.usajobs.gov — federal jobs)
#   USAJOBS_USER_AGENT=           (the email the USAJOBS key is registered to — required)
# See ingestion/README.md.
